{"availability":"available","full":"ArthurSonzogni/RTXUI","name":"RTXUI","description":"C++ reactive terminal user interfaces built from HTML templates, CSS, and plain C++ state.","category":"Design","language":"C++","stars":12,"forks":0,"created":"2024-06-14T21:09:16Z","updated":"2026-10-15T21:38:14Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://arthursonzogni.github.io/RTXUI/","topics":["cpp23","css","html","reactive","terminal","terminal-ui","tui","webassembly"],"demo":"https://arthursonzogni.github.io/RTXUI/#interactive-playground","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T07:09:59.441Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T07:09:59.441Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T07:09:59.441Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.378Z","stars":12,"forks":1},{"at":"2026-10-17T07:09:59.441Z","stars":12,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["RTXUI brings the browser's declarative rendering pipeline to modern C++.","Structure interfaces with semantic HTML. Style them with real CSS (flexbox, grid, cascade, and transitions). Bind plain C++ state; mutate a variable and the engine diffs the DOM and repaints the terminal."],"features":["HTML & CSS in C++: Semantic HTML tags styled with standard CSS. Full support for flexbox, grid, cascade specificity, pseudo-classes (:hover, :focus, :active), and transitions.","Reactive State Binding: Bind C++ member variables and callbacks directly to template tokens ({count}, onclick=\"Increment\"). Mutating state triggers surgical DOM diffing and repaints.","🔥 Live Template Hot Reloading: Call EnableHotReload(). Edit your HTML/CSS templates in your editor and watch the running terminal UI update in <10ms without recompiling or restarting.","WebAssembly Ready: Compile the exact same codebase to WebAssembly with Emscripten to run full-speed in modern web browsers.","Spatial Navigation & Focus: Built-in sequential Tab cycling, dynamic Arrow-key spatial navigation, and mouse event routing."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni/RTXUI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"aa7f16fd6a1dd8dd57780c91d04d48cebc7b7b44b719f5169e8f53ca0c2f85b8","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.429Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.429Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"RTXUI brings the browser's declarative rendering pipeline to modern C++.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni/RTXUI/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"aa7f16fd6a1dd8dd57780c91d04d48cebc7b7b44b719f5169e8f53ca0c2f85b8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni/RTXUI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.430Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T06:26:58Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ArthurSonzogni/RTXUI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.430Z","hash":"aa7f16fd6a1dd8dd57780c91d04d48cebc7b7b44b719f5169e8f53ca0c2f85b8","originalBytes":6736,"storedBytes":6736,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:26:09.378Z","subjects":["Templates & UI components"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":["Templates & UI components"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Templates & UI components","source":"metadata","match":"templates"}],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Apple","Data & dashboards"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://arthursonzogni.github.io/RTXUI/#interactive-playground","attemptedAt":"2026-10-17T07:33:07.691Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T07:33:07.691Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-17T07:33:07.691Z","target":"https://arthursonzogni.github.io/RTXUI/#interactive-playground","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-24T07:33:07.691Z"},"previewAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T07:33:07.691Z","previewCheck":{"url":"https://arthursonzogni.github.io/RTXUI/#int